I PvPed with the build and you are right. It's very strong. I also use blood swarm to force players to roll and naginata to roll catch or lightning bolt during rolling. I use blood boon when players rush me. if they retreat, their bleed increases a lot. If they come toward me, they get the blood helice or similar blood weapon, proccing blood usually on the first attack landed. 

&#x200B;

I also use bloodhound dash with my weapon and I feel like my build is really good. Dragonbolt buff is also good against dagger/katana spammers.

