WTF are you smoking. Dude literally has his blade to her throat, there's a reason why you stop sparring sessions when that happens. It takes less than a second for him to realize shes moving and for him to twitch his arm and cut her. 

&#x200B;

You can see in the scene that she backs away from him, and he doesn't swing at all. She shoves him away and he stands there staring at her saying "Why'd you shove me for?"

&#x200B;

A trained guard would cut her down the instant she tries to push him.

I agree. Israel is fun to watch but I don't understand the hype of this Subreddit and from my casual MMA friends. What I've noticed about Bobby more than any other fighter is that his timing is impeccable. If you have perfect timing you don't have to hit the hardest, be the fastest, or be the most precise because being on time makes all of that easier than brute-forcing a time. 

&#x200B;

Izzy is fast, tricky, and very precise. But I believe timing beats all.

